  _glyph: 
  _subtitle: Chapter 2
  _description: '[[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy Gale]] wakes up in
    the land of the Munchkins. The [[b9b0ae12-dc06-4854-9663-ce87377480f2|Good Witch
    of the North]] sends her to the Wizard and gives her the [[ea4cb543-34a9-48d6-9037-6af7bf319ac6|Silver
    Shoes]].'
